\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Mechanical Engineering Skills. An engineer states a goal by voice or text. The Claude agent understands the request, selects the relevant skills from a library of 32 (design and CAD, analysis and simulation, manufacturing), and orchestrates them. Each skill bundles instructions (\texttt  {SKILL.md}), tested scripts that do the computation, and checks. The results---CAD models, simulations, process plans, designs and reports---come back with the evidence that supports them. Nineteen skills package research papers from our laboratory. No per-tool training or locally hosted model is required for the default workflows; voice input and execution depend on the host and the installed tools.}}{2}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
\providecommand*\caption@xref[2]{\@setref\relax\@undefined{#1}}
\newlabel{fig:concept}{{1}{2}{Mechanical Engineering Skills. An engineer states a goal by voice or text. The Claude agent understands the request, selects the relevant skills from a library of 32 (design and CAD, analysis and simulation, manufacturing), and orchestrates them. Each skill bundles instructions (\texttt {SKILL.md}), tested scripts that do the computation, and checks. The results---CAD models, simulations, process plans, designs and reports---come back with the evidence that supports them. Nineteen skills package research papers from our laboratory. No per-tool training or locally hosted model is required for the default workflows; voice input and execution depend on the host and the installed tools}{figure.caption.1}{}}
